I'm going to choose... 2. Not as much as before. It feels like that's the most accurate. I still laugh, but it's just not as often or as easily as it was before having the baby.

.. I'm going to be honest, it's been a struggle to look forward to things like I used to. I mean, I'm excited to see my baby grow and all, but other than that, it's hard to get excited about anything else. I feel like I'm just trying to get through each day. So, if I had to choose... 

