I would say... 2. Yes, sometimes I haven't been coping as well as usual. That's pretty much how it's been. Some days are okay, but others feel like I'm just barely holding on.

.. yeah, that's been a real issue for me. Even when the baby is sleeping, I'll lie awake at night, just feeling really down and overwhelmed. It's not just the baby waking me up, although that doesn't help. It's like, my mind is racing, and I just can't turn it off. I'll be lying there thinking about everything, and feeling really unhappy, and it makes it hard to fall asleep or stay asleep.

