.. yeah, that's a big part of it for me. I feel sad or miserable a lot of the time. It's not just the baby blues, it's like... a deeper feeling. I feel like I'm just going through the motions, and I'm not really enjoying anything. Even when I'm doing things that I used to love, it just doesn't feel the same. It's like there's this cloud hanging over me, and I just can't shake it.

