.. yeah, I've been crying a few times. It's usually when I feel really overwhelmed or sad. Sometimes it's just a little thing that will trigger it, and I'll start crying. It's not always related to the baby, sometimes it's just... everything. It feels like I'm just at my breaking point, and I don't know how to make it stop.

